comments.body:
@ClassicLarry  I'm setting up some post-training scaling experiments, and a few raw intermediate checkpoints from the 67B-A2B 10T run would help a lot, if it's feasible on your end. Ideally at roughly 3x spacing: ~70B, ~220B, ~660B, and ~2T tokens. No cooldown needed.

Happy to pull them from wherever's easiest, GCS/CoreWeave, an HF export, whatever's least effort.

Thanks!
